{"id":"n79611-1-8","stage":3,"title":"초승달 · 新月","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79611-1-8-1","ko":"승규야, 저기 하늘 좀 봐.","zh":"承奎，快看那边的天空。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하늘","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24db4c23be2c0c978699.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79611-1-8-2","ko":"우와, 초승달이 떴네? 무지 밝다.","zh":"哇，出现新月啦？亮极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"초승달이","meaning":"新月","explanation":"초승달：新月；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초승달","audio":"/audio/01828a9dc6db2776895c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79611","senseId":"1","lemma":"초승달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떴네?","meaning":"漂，浮","explanation":"뜨다：漂，浮；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무지","meaning":"特别，十分，格外","explanation":"무지：特别，十分，格外","readings":[{"term":"무지","audio":"/audio/0efed567b77e1a8aa81e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55146","senseId":"1","lemma":"무지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밝다.","meaning":"亮","explanation":"밝다：亮；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"1","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3","definition":"惊讶、赞叹时的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01828a9dc6db2776","term":"초승달","zh":"新月","audio":"/audio/01828a9dc6db2776895c.mp3","entryId":"79611","definition":"自农历每月初一到几天内升起的月亮。","pronunciation":["초승딸"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"漂，浮","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"66028","definition":"在水面上或空中，或向上涌起。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"0efed567b77e1a8a","term":"무지","zh":"特别，十分，格外","audio":"/audio/0efed567b77e1a8aa81e.mp3","entryId":"55146","definition":"相当且厉害地。","pronunciation":["무지"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"亮","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"某物体发出的光很明亮。","pronunciation":["박따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c759e2f5cdfa5e2f668b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79611","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":92,"sequenceScore":2.4767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哇，出现新月啦？亮极了。","请把视线看向正前方，看这里。我要拍照了。","承奎，快看那边的天空。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哇，出现新月啦？亮极了。","承奎，快看那边的天空。","请把视线看向正前方，看这里。我要拍照了。"],"answer":0}]}
